{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_021_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48203de25467193f6fe63aad813555524ae19e17106192e7e2a191aefe825929",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a7b7fc7dc9a8143755807c5bb713bb2310c075f3a35b072764f17930746cc73",
      "text": "给我的巧克力吗……？说起来，今天是情人节呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ec66d2d1c5db6bb22aff0374d023ac2e5580384e127bd12d9ab3065afd0845a",
      "text": "我对这类节日向来不太敏感，完全给忘了。还让您特意费心，真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:263f7d0988a7ed08da71d78312c07aefcc005f8fb46aef1cfde4f70f2fcdf81b",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢您的巧克力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca8489996d331df5d66b7dfe885a5cfc53ac06038ce98ff2e309eb9ae8550521",
      "text": "等接下来的训练课结束之后，我再享用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f64a6dd5f95bfc5bd58c63b3c4f32e29c91b79d280b010840ff935cd7dd26c5",
      "text": "那么，我先过去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cf553386ff46a0b86e3325306a13aaab2d9cc947412c15f6c5e8e449e7f6b4e",
      "text": "这是巧克力吗……？啊啊，因为今天是情人节……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:435db39354bcaeb312246891deb83159edb695a0846f2a0060da59392d081fc5",
      "text": "隼人他们之所以那么吵闹，原来是因为这个啊。……啊啊，不好意思，是我自言自语。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e77a18b7fbd179c8b404163373aa8e365b81fe30ffa82e65b696c6c932e2443",
      "text": "还让您特意为我准备，真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fd0b20bfb5e10e5565a28efb832b4d01d9dd17d19e5204e722e9b02f9e7b100",
      "text": "我以前从没留意过这类节日，总觉得挺新鲜的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d49d364cfa142a7cf12df910fb5a2b6702241a0f2b06f9cc6032817b90e3422d",
      "text": "既然是制作人特意送我的，我会好好珍惜享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7164ff0212cb9a6cc357d4ff9613cd3640a83acef757d83b53a1f023a74a2d3c",
      "text": "若能合你的口味就再好不过了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46078c460ccaf9d40f7f237cb5272478bef9e29cf2c3a9dcddbd895311d026bf",
      "text": "请务必收下！这是我对旬先生的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49e291b0c26d978f3428f4d7f01c2753c6fee411e043917549987204e01c6113",
      "text": "非常感谢， ●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0a75d37bf2dc2c33fb9598620410c5a2d55e8b394d0da05c731ca3667fa3cf2",
      "text": "是这样吗。那我也会在白色情人节回礼的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_021_22:5_01_021_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4be6fc871ad95532c2e4923f34028f76fef92c58876c2c647e90ec054dd2e50",
      "text": "那么我接下来还有训练课，就先告辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
